  The bridge/ implementation in this repository is adapted from the
  internal bridge component used in iddofroom/meeting-copilot, which itself
  drew on the ccgram architecture.

The naming conventions for the wire protocol (the "bridge" terminology
and the queued/sent/failed outbox pattern) trace back to the original
ccgram design. Where this project diverges — schema names, the standalone
Next.js admin UI, the scheduling layer, and the external callback API —
the implementation is original.

